  Uniform +$1k (Scen. 1)               0.0407    0.4238   (0.0580)
  Low-income +$2k (Scen. 2)            0.0197    0.3073   (0.0870)
  STEM ug +$3k (Scen. 3)               0.0295    0.2318   (0.0974)
  Education ug +$2.5k (Scen. 4)        0.0094    0.1867   (0.1682)
  STEM pipeline +$2.5k (Scen. 5)       0.0248    0.2423   (0.0953)
  Business pipeline +$2.5k (Scen. 6)   0.0144    0.7203   (0.1889)
  Education pipeline +$2.5k (Scen. 7)  0.0094    0.1867   (0.1682)
  Health pipeline +$2.5k (Scen. 8)     0.0796    0.3345   (0.0666)

